    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ESCAPE WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/0fb38d082e8a32c957dfc9e9b31c6c7f.poster.avif?t=1748455566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/0fb38d082e8a32c957dfc9e9b31c6c7f.webm?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/0fb38d082e8a32c957dfc9e9b31c6c7f.mp4?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Play alone or in a team of up to 6 players! Challenge yourself with the 60-min time limit, or take your time and play in Relax mode with unlimited time!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND CLUES AND SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/857a03aea76107ba16122af55ee875d6.poster.avif?t=1748455566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/857a03aea76107ba16122af55ee875d6.webm?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/857a03aea76107ba16122af55ee875d6.mp4?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Interact and examine</i></strong><i> with dozens of objects to uncover the secrets of the rooms.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chapter 1: The Mansion Lab</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/9feacbc9671cbc2d346ca7fcd2132ff9.poster.avif?t=1748455566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/9feacbc9671cbc2d346ca7fcd2132ff9.webm?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/9feacbc9671cbc2d346ca7fcd2132ff9.mp4?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You have been &quot;invited&quot; by Professor Cheshire and his assistant Hildegarde to try their new experiments. They are obsessed with people\u2019s minds and want to see how you react to their tests.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chapter 2: Memory Loss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/79626cdd8a69f2f32f0f4382a6df2774.poster.avif?t=1748455566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/79626cdd8a69f2f32f0f4382a6df2774.webm?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/79626cdd8a69f2f32f0f4382a6df2774.mp4?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Cheshire's experimentations damaged your brain and you are now in a coma. Hildegarde wants to help you to wake up by recovering your memory...</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chapter 3: Lost Childhood</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/e3f967b5df7eef6ec7cf606bfd5973b2.poster.avif?t=1748455566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/e3f967b5df7eef6ec7cf606bfd5973b2.webm?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/e3f967b5df7eef6ec7cf606bfd5973b2.mp4?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You will keep diving into the past of Hildegarde. In her child room, you will witness what her daily life looked like when she got into Cheshire's lab.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ESCAPE WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/0fb38d082e8a32c957dfc9e9b31c6c7f.poster.avif?t=1748455566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/0fb38d082e8a32c957dfc9e9b31c6c7f.webm?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/0fb38d082e8a32c957dfc9e9b31c6c7f.mp4?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Play alone or in a team of up to 6 players! Challenge yourself with the 60-min time limit, or take your time and play in Relax mode with unlimited time!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND CLUES AND SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/857a03aea76107ba16122af55ee875d6.poster.avif?t=1748455566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/857a03aea76107ba16122af55ee875d6.webm?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/857a03aea76107ba16122af55ee875d6.mp4?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Interact and examine</i></strong><i> with dozens of objects to uncover the secrets of the rooms.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chapter 1: The Mansion Lab</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/9feacbc9671cbc2d346ca7fcd2132ff9.poster.avif?t=1748455566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/9feacbc9671cbc2d346ca7fcd2132ff9.webm?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/9feacbc9671cbc2d346ca7fcd2132ff9.mp4?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You have been &quot;invited&quot; by Professor Cheshire and his assistant Hildegarde to try their new experiments. They are obsessed with people\u2019s minds and want to see how you react to their tests.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chapter 2: Memory Loss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/79626cdd8a69f2f32f0f4382a6df2774.poster.avif?t=1748455566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/79626cdd8a69f2f32f0f4382a6df2774.webm?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/79626cdd8a69f2f32f0f4382a6df2774.mp4?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Cheshire's experimentations damaged your brain and you are now in a coma. Hildegarde wants to help you to wake up by recovering your memory...</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chapter 3: Lost Childhood</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/e3f967b5df7eef6ec7cf606bfd5973b2.poster.avif?t=1748455566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/e3f967b5df7eef6ec7cf606bfd5973b2.webm?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1201550/extras/e3f967b5df7eef6ec7cf606bfd5973b2.mp4?t=1748455566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You will keep diving into the past of Hildegarde. In her child room, you will witness what her daily life looked like when she got into Cheshire's lab.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Award-nominated escape game. Alone or with up to 5 players, explore 3 unique rooms, solve mind-bending puzzles, and unravel the dark secrets of the Professor Cheshire and his experiments.",
